* RGC with PMOS current-mirror output (no negative-RC path)
* LTspice: File > Open (All files) > this .net > Run.  Keep ptm90.lib in this folder.
* One analysis at a time: un-comment the one you want with ";" removed.
.include ptm90.lib
.temp 35

Vdd vdd 0 dc 1
Cpd in 0 450f
CL out 0 50f
Iin 0 in dc 0 ac 1
Ibn vdd vbn dc 20u
Mdn vbn vbn 0 0 nmos90 W=1u L=200n AD=0.2p AS=0.2p PD=2.4u PS=2.4u
Cbn vbn 0 2p
Mb in vbn 0 0 nmos90 W=17.06u L=200n AD=3.413p AS=3.413p PD=34.53u PS=34.53u
M1 d1 x in 0 nmos90 W=27.2u L=100n AD=5.44p AS=5.44p PD=54.8u PS=54.8u
M2 x in 0 0 nmos90 W=20.18u L=100n AD=4.035p AS=4.035p PD=40.75u PS=40.75u
R2 vdd x 1.4867k
Mp1 d1 d1 vdd vdd pmos90 W=37.34u L=100n AD=7.468p AS=7.468p PD=75.08u PS=75.08u
Mp2 out d1 vdd vdd pmos90 W=38.84u L=100n AD=7.769p AS=7.769p PD=78.09u PS=78.09u
RL out 0 285.06

.ac dec 40 1Meg 100G
;.noise V(out) Iin dec 40 1Meg 100G
;.op
;.tran 0 6.667e-08 6.667e-09 6.667e-12   ; eye: replace Iin by the PRBS source below
;Ipr 0 in PWL file=prbs7_3G.txt   ; 20 uA pk-pk NRZ PRBS7 (prbs7_*.txt is in this folder)
.meas AC zt0 FIND mag(V(out)) AT 10Meg
.meas AC zpk MAX mag(V(out))
.meas AC f3db WHEN mag(V(out))=zt0/sqrt(2) FALL=1
.backanno
.end
